  "id": 10267748499757,
  "title": "Nesso 10ml",
  "handle": "nesso-10ml",
  "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Ginger and Italian orange fizz up like the first pour, champagne sparkling over the top. Then the flowers arrive: magnolia, jasmine and tuberose, lush and a little heady. Honey thickens it all into something sweet and sticky, while cedarwood and patchouli keep it warm and grounded.<br></p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Ginger, Italian Orange, Champagne</em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Magnolia, Jasmine, Tuberose</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Honey, <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Cedarwood, Patchouli</em></p>",
