  "id": 10267747385645,
  "title": "Ribeira 10ml",
  "handle": "ribeira-10ml",
  "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Clove, saffron and thyme open warm and spicy, nothing like the vanilla you were expecting. Leather and heliotrope add a smooth, almost powdery depth at the heart. Then bourbon vanilla and incense take over: rich, dark and smoky, vanilla pushed as far from simple as it goes.<br></p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Clove, Saffron, Thyme</em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Leather, Heliotrope</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes: <em>Vanilla Bourbon, Incense</em></p>",
  "published_at": "2026-04-30T09:36:46+03:00",
