 {
  "id": 10267744567597,
  "title": "Urla 10ml",
  "handle": "urla-10ml",
  "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Sweet meets salt. Warm skin meets cold sea. Ripe fig, a sharp bite of blackcurrant, basil and violet leaf running green and cool, salt in the air — and a warm, skin-close base that stays on you after a swim.<br></p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Fig, Cardamom Guatemala, B<span>lackcurrant</span></em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Basil, Sea Water, Violet Leaf</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes: <em>Driftwood, <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Sandalwood, Ambergris</em></p>",
