  "handle": "disco-set",
  "body_html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>URLA</strong> — An unfiltered Aegean morning.<br><br>FIG | BASIL | SEA WATER<br><br><strong>MANCHE</strong> — Just the real scent of the sea, not clean.<br><br>BERGAMOT | SEAWEED | SAGE<br><br><strong>NESSO</strong> — An innocent bouquet with champagne spilled on it.<br><br>CHAMPAGNE | JASMINE | HONEY<br><br><strong>RIBEIRA</strong> — A complex vanilla in its purest form.<br><br>CLOVE | REAL VANILLA | INCENSE</p>",
