  "body_html": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"bf79f669-315c-4198-b20f-b1805dae554c\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto whitespace-normal\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Bergamot opens bright and citrus-sharp, but this sea was never going to stay clean. Cucumber and galbanum bring a cold, green snap, sage cuts in bitter, and seaweed drags it all back to the water: salt, brine, something alive. Amber and sandalwood keep it close to warm skin.</p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Calabrian Bergamot, Galbanum, Cucumber</em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Sage, Rose</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes: <em>Seaweed, <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Amber, <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Sandalwood</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"border-left: 3px solid #a42325; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: inherit;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600;\">If it's your first time, start with 10ML.</p>\n<strong><a style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #000000; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" href=\"/products/manche-10ml\">See the 10ML option →</a></strong>\n</div>",
