 {
  "id": 9757066133805,
  "title": "Ribeira 100ml",
  "handle": "ribeira-100ml",
  "body_html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Clove, saffron and thyme open warm and spicy, nothing like the vanilla you were expecting. Leather and heliotrope add a smooth, almost powdery depth at the heart. Then bourbon vanilla and incense take over: rich, dark and smoky, vanilla pushed as far from simple as it goes.</p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Clove, Saffron, Thyme</em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Leather, Heliotrope</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes: <em>Vanilla Bourbon, Incense</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"border-left: 3px solid #a42325; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: inherit;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600;\">If it's your first time, start with 10ML.</p>\n<strong><a style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #000000; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" href=\"/products/ribeira-10ml\">See the 10ML option →</a></strong>\n</div>",
