  "title": "Nesso 100ml",
  "handle": "nesso-100ml",
  "body_html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Ginger and Italian orange fizz up like the first pour, champagne sparkling over the top. Then the flowers arrive: magnolia, jasmine and tuberose, lush and a little heady. Honey thickens it all into something sweet and sticky, while cedarwood and patchouli keep it warm and grounded.</p>\n<p>Top notes<strong>: </strong><em>Ginger, Italian Orange, Champagne</em></p>\n<p>Middle Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Magnolia, Jasmine, Tuberose</em></p>\n<p>Base Notes:<strong> </strong><em>Honey, <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Cedarwood, Patchouli</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"border-left: 3px solid #a42325; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: inherit;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600;\">If it's your first time, start with 10ML.</p>\n<strong><a style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #000000; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" href=\"/products/nesso-10ml\">See the 10ML option →</a></strong>\n</div>",
